## Build GUI binding using Gradle

The Android binding can be built using Gradle. To do so, you need to have the following dependencies in your `build.gradle` file:

```groovy
dependencies {
    implementation "org.ggml/llama.android:llama.android:0.1.0"
}
```

Then, you need to have the following dependencies in your `build.gradle.kts` file:

